s that power up your tiles. Letter affinities mean you'll always have a letter in your pool, and tile enchantments give a variety of powers to your monsters. Choose carefully how to upgrade--you'll need to choose rewards that counter your upcoming enemies and synergize well together.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >26 Starting Classes</h2><br>Unlock a variety of starting classes, each with their own strengths and weaknesses.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Randomized runs keep things fresh</h2><br>Randomized enemies, terrain, upgrades, and final boss battle give each run its own flavor.",
